  "cos φ = factorul de putere. La rezistor pur, cos φ = 1. La motoare, cos φ < 1 (există putere reactivă).": "cos φ = power factor. In pure resistor, cos φ = 1. In motors, cos φ < 1 ​​(there is reactive power).",
